- [x] Provide read-only `browser chatgpt-status` and opt-in bridge registration.
- [x] Require local API token when a real account-backed browser adapter is enabled.
- [x] Add fake UI tests and real Chromium test using only injected HTML.
- [x] Allow the optional Windows DOM test to use the saved portable Chromium executable.
- [ ] Validate actual ChatGPT public UI selectors with the current permitted account.
- [ ] Improve robust turn identity / DOM virtualization handling.
- [ ] Verify if selected browser can use supported sign-in without a security challenge.
